  "answer": "Under **“Red Flag Questions,”** the questionnaire tells investors to ask a manager:\n\n- Have any senior investment professionals left in the last five years? If so, what happened?\n- Has the firm or any of its principals faced client complaints, regulatory actions, or pending litigation?\n- What is the strategy’s current capacity limit, and at what asset level would growth impair its ability to deploy capital?\n- What might cause the manager to close the fund to new investors?\n- What is the biggest risk to the strategy that keeps the manager up at night?\n\nSource: *Calamos/Aksia Private Markets Due Diligence Questionnaire*, p. 2.",
